Subject: Fil-C pointer/offset conversions for fontconfig 2.17
Origin: Filnix, rebased from ports/patch/fontconfig-2.15.0.patch
Upstream-Status: Not submitted

Nixpkgs 26.05 packages fontconfig 2.17.1, whose clang-formatted fcint.h no
longer matches the extracted 2.15.0 port. The change is otherwise identical:
serialized offsets are converted through FcPtrToOffsetImpl and
FcOffsetToPtrImpl so decoded pointers keep their capability. Replace this
with the extracted patch once upstream ports a 2.17 release.

diff --git a/src/fcfilc.c b/src/fcfilc.c
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ed5bff9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/fcfilc.c
@@ -0,0 +1,51 @@
